{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "hub.hallmark",
  "kind": "skill",
  "name": "Hallmark",
  "summary": "Design skill for websites and new pages that look designed, not generated: a non-waivable floor against model defaults, a dealt theme so consecutive builds do not converge, one idea per screen, a sloplint sweep at 320-1920 px, and audit/redesign verbs when Hallmark is named. OpenAR-adapted carry of nutlope/hallmark 2.0.0: the home-directory installer and the ~/.claude/settings.json edit-time hook are not carried; image generation is opt-in with the user's own Together AI key. Everything else is upstream.",
